{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Dexterity 13 or higher\n\nYou have extensive combat experience with ranged weapons. You are at your most lethal when using a bow, gaining the following benefits:\n\n- You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls you make with a longbow or shortbow.\n\n- When you use an action to make an attack with a longbow or a shortbow, you can take a bonus action to attack again with the bow.\n\n- Being within 5 feet of a hostile creature doesn’t impose disadvantage on your ranged attack rolls.","level":1}],"id":"Custom953d60c2-d0d5-4447-9d18-5b05bf1e4089","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Bow Master [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}